</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/62ef6a3e-d7f8-11f1-871b-bf1914cabd52/w:1024/p:16x9/psg-1-2.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/62ef6a3e-d7f8-11f1-871b-bf1914cabd52/w:1024/p:16x9/psg-1-2.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">c7bc79ca-d7f8-11f1-a8ea-f94bc89b44a0</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 10:31:25 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>L'Equipe TV</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>DR Congo residents sue Chinese mining giant for widespread pollution</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20261104-dr-congo-residents-sue-chinese-mining-giant-for-widespread-pollution</link><description>
